entityDescription:
fleXstructures Italia S.r.l. is a limited liability company, subsidiary of fleXstructures GmbH, the Headquarter, based in Kaiserslautern, Germany.
fleXstructures Italia S.r.l. has the rights for marketing and distribution of the IPS product family.
fleXstructures Italia S.r.l. carries out the following activities:
- Software trade;
- Hardware trade;
- Trade of instruments/measuring devices;
- Trade of consumables and spare parts for instruments/measuring devices;
- Engineering, design and development services in the computer field;
- Research, development and innovation in the field of information technology both in Italy and abroad, also in partnership with other Italian and/or foreign companies and/or bodies:
- Hardware and software support services;
- Market development services related to computer products;
- Acting as agents for computer products of Italian or foreign companies;
- Planning, realization, building of electronic equipment and production of the relative software in general; maintenance and support service for hardware and software in general; wiring setups in general.

